00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:11.200
Okay, so I know this one,

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.320
Tom Cruise is driving a motorcycle

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:15.270
very fast, in California,

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.940
with no helmet on whatsoever.

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:20.780
That is a violation of
California's vehicular code.

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:23.810
It might be petty, but it's a $250 fine,

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:26.520
and or a year of probation.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:27.353
- Oh yeah, yeah.

00:06:27.353 --> 00:06:30.070
And I mean, these pilots are probably

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:31.820
radioing into the tower saying,

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:34.820
who the hell is this random guy

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:36.890
driving his motorcycle
along the flight line,

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:38.600
