00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.730
I'd get an investigation, at least.

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:43.360
- And also as someone
who rides a motorcycle,

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:45.580
I can't fathom riding without a helmet.

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:46.720
I know there are some states

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:50.390
that you can ride a
motorcycle without a helmet.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:53.810
First of all, it's dangerous
enough without a helmet.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:54.940
Like you should wear a helmet

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:57.430
because the injuries of people
