00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.670
are gruesome and grotesque.

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:01.950
But also, if you're riding really fast,

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:03.160
there's so much wind,

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:06.190
your aviator sunglasses
don't do that much.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:07.250
So if you value your life,

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:10.720
please wear a helmet while
you ride a motorcycle,

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:14.310
whether it's in California
or anywhere else, please.

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:15.770
- I'm Charlotte Blackwood.

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:17.010
- I'm Maverick.

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:17.843
- Maverick?

00:07:19.043 --> 00:07:20.960
Does your mother not
like you or something?

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.910
- No, it's my call sign.

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:25.530
- Okay, that is so cringe.

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:27.500
That is so, so cringe.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:29.280
You just don't do that.

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:31.840
That is the biggest
dork move in the world.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:32.980
