00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:35.313
- He's introducing himself
by his call sign to-

00:07:35.313 --> 00:07:36.640
- Oh! (laughing)

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.020
- I mean, that is so cringe,

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.830
but it's also unrealistic.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:43.580
And the reason it's
unrealistic is because no one,

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:46.040
no one has a cool call sign like that.

